    <span>Ribeye</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span>Lamb Chops</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span>Goat Khasi</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span>Desi Chicken</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span>Seekh Kebab</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span class="text-saffron-300">Qurbani 2027</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span>Tenderloin</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span>Chicken Tikka</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span><span>Brisket</span><span class="text-saffron-400">✦</span>
